          "id": 1974226003,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Looks like FreeRADIUS already changed some of those to integer: https://github.com/FreeRADIUS/freeradius-server/commit/d18d9457361cab03d5cc8f10000986ca7cb5b584\n\nBut also changed `Huawei-NAT-Port-Forwarding` too.\n\nAlso see https://github.com/FreeRADIUS/freeradius-server/issues/2803 for the `ipv6prefix` vs `ipv6addr` issue.",
